# No AI Attribution in Commits

This is a client project. Never include any AI or Cursor-related messages in commits.

- Do NOT add any trailer like `Co-authored-by: cursor`, `Generated by Cursor`, or similar
- Do NOT mention Cursor, AI, Copilot, or any AI tool in commit messages
- Keep commit messages clean, professional, and human-written
- Write commit messages that describe the actual change concisely
